            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Current production technology, environmental issues have been addressed in the past.\n\n# Included processes\nThe inventory includes processes of material, energy and water use in vehicle manufacturing. Also, VOC emissions are accounted for. Rail and road transport of materials are considered. Plant infrastructure is not included. Energy consumption for de-ionised water is included in the electricty value. Material expenditures are not accounted for. Transport of vehicle parts between the different sites is excluded.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
